{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47440","headline":"献郑思远施真人二仙 · 吕岩","name":"献郑思远施真人二仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万劫千生到此生，此生身始觉飞轻。\n抛家别国云山外，炼魄全魂日月精。\n比见至人论九鼎，欲穷大药访三清。\n如今获遇真仙面，紫府仙扉得姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}